  "steps": [
    "Dice onion. Season chicken with salt, pepper, garlic powder and oregano.",
    "Fry chicken in oil on medium-high 1 minute per side; remove.",
    "Fry onion 2 minutes. Add rice; stir 1 minute. Add broth powder dissolved in 300g water; bring to boil.",
    "Return chicken; reduce heat to low; cover and simmer 15\u201318 minutes until rice is cooked.",
    "Remove chicken; stir in laughing cow wedges until creamy. Slice chicken; return to pan."
